205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-26T14:19:38-08:00","id":1370646,"title":"","content":"Sorry. I forget what Seeds are. For that matter, I\u2019m blanking on Soft Leverage. The furthest I\u2019ve gotten in Princess is creating a character and a diceless Prelude. I\u2019m probably not the best person to discuss the details of the rules with.<br /> <br /> That being said, I DO have an opinion on currency. I think on Earth the Nobles use regular currency (most probably use credit or debit cards). I don\u2019t think there is any currency in the Dreamlands. The Radiant Queens are supposed to rule over a utopian society, and money isn\u2019t very utopian. I do think Princesses (and Princes) like jewelry and give each other pieces of jewelry on special occasions.<br /> <br /> Can you explain the difference between the Kingdom and the Dreamlands? That always confused me.<br /> <br /> Also, why did they ban you? That sounds really harsh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-26T17:38:34-08:00","id":1370688,"title":"","content":"Seeds are Created with the level 2 Govern Charm &quot;Seed of light&quot;<br /> <br /> The Kingdom was Ancient and no longer exists though some princesses seek to rebuild it on earth again.<br /> <br /> The Dreamlands still exist.<br /> <br /> On why I got banned I had divisive political opinions.<br /> <br /> I Had trouble not asking loaded Questions as Sadly its hard to tell if its loaded or not as a presupposition can be quite transparent to you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png